Author: Michael Yankelev <myankelev@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Sep 20 16:12:32 2026 +0200

    refactor(engine): share the live permission rule and the shared list poll

    The fallback to the bookmark's accept-time permission now lives in one
    function next to the verdict type, and the three /shared poll helpers
    share one private reader. The downgrade test reuses the shared_row
    helper and needs one pass, which is the empirical minimum.

